<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post9208529414510079903..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Drug War&#39;s Einsatzgruppen</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>24</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7484713666566462551</id><published>2013-01-23T21:02:16.252-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-23T21:02:16.252-07:00</updated><title type='text'>What a great piece of writing.  How come no one ha...</title><content type='html'> What a great piece of writing.  How come no one has scooped you up.  Silly me, as the Neville Brothers tune points out, &amp;quot;It&amp;#39;s freedom of speech until you say too much&amp;quot;.  And you my dear sir are Too Much!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; in the love of the Lord Jesus Christ my Brother. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/7484713666566462551'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/7484713666566462551'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1359000136252#c7484713666566462551' title=''/><author><name>Jubal</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-341583813"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 23, 2013 at 9:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6157711111559860052</id><published>2011-07-04T12:00:39.527-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-04T12:00:39.527-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Keep up the hard-hitting essays, Will.  You&amp;#39;re...</title><content type='html'>Keep up the hard-hitting essays, Will.  You&amp;#39;re the best.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/6157711111559860052'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/6157711111559860052'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309802439527#c6157711111559860052' title=''/><author><name>Anthony Powell</name><uri>http://Powell-Shirts.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-632975550"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 4, 2011 at 12:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4925847974274445432</id><published>2011-07-04T00:09:42.607-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-04T00:09:42.607-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Could this be accurate?  If so, it&amp;#39;s something...</title><content type='html'>Could this be accurate?  If so, it&amp;#39;s something that warrants further investigation:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Iraq War Deaths Exceed Vietnam War Numbers&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.viewzone.com/wardeaths.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4925847974274445432'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4925847974274445432'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309759782607#c4925847974274445432' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-917414626"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 4, 2011 at 12:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4708558711978029503</id><published>2011-07-03T23:03:44.196-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-03T23:03:44.196-06:00</updated><title type='text'>All Federal taxpayer funding of local &amp;quot;law en...</title><content type='html'>All Federal taxpayer funding of local &amp;quot;law enforcement&amp;quot; must cease.  This country is turning into another Nazi Germany or Stalinist Russia.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Long live the breakup of these United States.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4708558711978029503'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4708558711978029503'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309755824196#c4708558711978029503' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 3, 2011 at 11:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1649305003680188937</id><published>2011-07-03T15:45:23.228-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-03T15:45:23.228-06:00</updated><title type='text'>ray said... &amp;quot;i&amp;#39;m old enough to remember w...</title><content type='html'>ray said... &amp;quot;i&amp;#39;m old enough to remember when law enforcement in america -- though very imperfect -- was not overtly predatory and vampiric&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well, I&amp;#39;m not that old and I cannot even conceive of what you mean. Perhaps that is the plan?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;in small or mid-size america in the fifties and early sixties, law enforcement was almost entirely local, and didnt engage in predation upon their own communities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;there was very little incursion from the feds, unless some major crime went down -- a kidnapping, multiple bank robbery, etc&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;all minor matters were handled locally, by cops and court personnel -- the city/county jail wasnt a moneymaking enterprise, constantly kept full of male &amp;quot;criminals&amp;quot; -- with some exceptions, you had to do something WAY out of line to get put in a cage&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;now, fuck... everybody is either a perpetrator or pre-perpetrator, and the &amp;quot;law&amp;quot; is completely corrupted by profit and ideo-political thuggery&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;hope that answers, at least a bit&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ray</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/1649305003680188937'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/1649305003680188937'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309729523228#c1649305003680188937' title=''/><author><name>ray</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11380746207592226835</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 3, 2011 at 3:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1518046764733161707</id><published>2011-07-03T09:01:12.910-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-03T09:01:12.910-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I have sympathy for the announcer because I ...</title><content type='html'>Will, I have sympathy for the announcer because I suspect he wasn&amp;#39;t given instructions on how to pronounce it.  Right now it rhymes with potentate.  Heck!  I didn&amp;#39;t know myself until I heard YOU on one of your broadcasts.  Ahhh...  such is life.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/1518046764733161707'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/1518046764733161707'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309705272910#c1518046764733161707' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 3, 2011 at 9:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3576594420265511613</id><published>2011-07-02T21:48:28.832-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-02T21:48:28.832-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I think this calls for a repeat of what I said on ...</title><content type='html'>I think this calls for a repeat of what I said on an earlier essay. I don&amp;#39;t think I can say it any better:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;These thugs treat us Mundanes as enemies. The more they abuse us, they know full well, the more angry we become. And then the more they are afraid of us. And then the more they abuse us. Do we all follow the vicious cycle? Until they are stopped by force, and the cycle of abuse is broken, it will only get worse, and worse, and worse. Non-violence and compliance with their orders WILL NOT WORK. That just makes them more apprehensive and more brutal.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Wake up and smell the coffee, people. America is no longer our land. This is now the land of the bankers, the corporations, the CEOs, the politicians, and the rich. These thugs are THEIR paid enforcers - whose salaries are paid by US, the taxpaying working class, to serve THEM, the non-taxpaying capitalist class.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;We, who just want enough to live on and to feed our children, are their enemy. They themselves have declared that we are their enemy. And they are our enemy. This is war. There are two choices: Fight back, or die.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Choose.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Lemuel Gulliver.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;PS: Does everyone know the origin of the word &amp;quot;Thug&amp;quot;? It comes from the Hindu word &amp;quot;Thuggee&amp;quot; meaning &amp;quot;Crocodile.&amp;quot; A crocodile is, first of all, a reptile. Cold blooded. Kissing cousin to lizards and rattlesnakes. Second, it is an opportunistic ambush predator, which lies concealed in wait for an unsuspecting victim peaceably going about his business. It drowns its victim, then waits for the body to decompose before tearing off chunks of the rotting flesh to feast on.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Doesn&amp;#39;t that pretty well describe the whole apparatus of American Law Enforcement Officialdom?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - Lemuel.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3576594420265511613'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3576594420265511613'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309664908832#c3576594420265511613' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-161344811"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2011 at 9:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3521443635435469273</id><published>2011-07-02T18:00:53.532-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-02T18:00:53.532-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Tom, thanks so much!&#xa;&#xa;Pro Libertate Radio is a pod...</title><content type='html'>Tom, thanks so much!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pro Libertate Radio is a podcast, not a live program, but unfortunately the bumper I was given by the network is from my old call-in program of the same name. A related annoyance is the fact that the announcer mis-pronounced the title of the show....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3521443635435469273'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3521443635435469273'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309651253532#c3521443635435469273' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-jPFv0cYu6Cc/TVtx6son2uI/AAAAAAAAHCU/52MmpBEjoEs/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2011 at 6:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3139543337097869505</id><published>2011-07-02T17:28:27.398-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-02T17:28:27.398-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg:&#xa;&#xa;I recently discovered your radio show ...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I recently discovered your radio show archives online and have been quite impressed. (I always try to be careful about saying I &amp;quot;enjoy&amp;quot; this sort of media, because the topic matter is often so infuriating and dismaying. That said, you do a wonderful job.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But I&amp;#39;m curious why the show&amp;#39;s intro identifies the program as live, given that there are obvious edits throughout. Are those just on the show version posted online?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3139543337097869505'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3139543337097869505'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309649307398#c3139543337097869505' title=''/><author><name>TomD</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1391926851"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2011 at 5:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3538391109324349306</id><published>2011-07-02T15:50:18.040-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-02T15:50:18.040-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There was another killed in Largo FL. My grandson ...</title><content type='html'>There was another killed in Largo FL. My grandson is a little boy with ASbergers Autism syndrome, so it makes me wonder what chances he will have if anyone calls the police on him. The young man murdered by cops was supposedly displaying a knife and threatened the police. The mother said that he was killed the instant they came in the house. Now, if she had read your articles, she may never have called the police, and would still have her only son alive.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3538391109324349306'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3538391109324349306'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309643418040#c3538391109324349306' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1996834181"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2011 at 3:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2981872293299527922</id><published>2011-07-02T10:51:10.491-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-02T10:51:10.491-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, check up near the early part, 4th paragraph....</title><content type='html'>Will, check up near the early part, 4th paragraph.  There you wrote, &amp;quot;After they murdered &lt;b&gt;Hampton&lt;/b&gt;, the police found about two-dozen different prescription drugs in the home, including various painkillers and medications for blood pressure, heart disease, and diabetes.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;They were Hampton polizei, perhaps, but they didn&amp;#39;t murder Hampton, they murdered Bill Cooper.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Newport News police are even worse.  Take it from someone who&amp;#39;s had to deal with those stasi thugs, first hand.  I advise anyone who lives in pig land, there, to form their own defensive networks and to begin recording, not for court, but for immediate release to the local community, so that the locals can get a good bit of understanding of exactly what &amp;quot;law and order&amp;quot; actually means.  Especially us &amp;quot;conservative&amp;quot; types who actually believe we have rights and believe the law is supposed to protect us in the exercising of said rights.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/2981872293299527922'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/2981872293299527922'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309625470491#c2981872293299527922' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-938277942"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2011 at 10:51 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1543478153843412247</id><published>2011-07-02T00:42:22.576-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-02T00:42:22.576-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another well-written column, Will!</title><content type='html'>Another well-written column, Will!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/1543478153843412247'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/1543478153843412247'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309588942576#c1543478153843412247' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2011 at 12:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4973908700933653462</id><published>2011-07-01T22:53:20.950-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-01T22:53:20.950-06:00</updated><title type='text'>ray said... &amp;quot;i&amp;#39;m old enough to remember w...</title><content type='html'>ray said... &amp;quot;i&amp;#39;m old enough to remember when law enforcement in america -- though very imperfect -- was not overtly predatory and vampiric&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well, I&amp;#39;m not that old and I cannot even conceive of what you mean. Perhaps that is the plan?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Every day that I read alternative news and opinions on the Internet I think something like, &amp;quot;the kind of first rate journalism our paid media are SUPPOSED to be doing&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4973908700933653462'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4973908700933653462'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309582400950#c4973908700933653462' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-725853693"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 1, 2011 at 10:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3545905366491898405</id><published>2011-07-01T02:08:57.186-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-01T02:08:57.186-06:00</updated><title type='text'>inventive writing and comprehensive coverage of th...</title><content type='html'>inventive writing and comprehensive coverage of the topic, mr. grigg, thanks&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the kind of first rate journalism our paid media are SUPPOSED to be doing&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;i&amp;#39;m old enough to remember when law enforcement in america -- though very imperfect -- was not overtly predatory and vampiric&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;we&amp;#39;re in freefall now ps pastor riddle i&amp;#39;ll second that last sentiment</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3545905366491898405'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3545905366491898405'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309507737186#c3545905366491898405' title=''/><author><name>ray</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11380746207592226835</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 1, 2011 at 2:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4950945841125166663</id><published>2011-07-01T02:05:49.576-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-01T02:05:49.576-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Pastor Riddle,  It&amp;#39;s the height of bitter iron...</title><content type='html'>Pastor Riddle,  It&amp;#39;s the height of bitter irony that these costumed cretins first &amp;quot;rob&amp;quot; us of our wealth, up front in the form of taxes to support their delusional gun-toting fantasies, then further rob or kill us on the receiving end of their remorseless &amp;quot;justice&amp;quot;.  And they draw a salary with a straight face.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4950945841125166663'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/4950945841125166663'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309507549576#c4950945841125166663' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 1, 2011 at 2:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3958852914338465359</id><published>2011-06-30T19:31:57.117-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-30T19:31:57.117-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;     It is amazing that the Indiana Supreme ...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;     It is amazing that the Indiana Supreme Court just &amp;#39;decided,&amp;#39;that it is not acceptable to shoot a cop that illegally enters your house.  That is amazing.  Just because they receive their income from taxes they can invade my house and kill me.  Atleast a criminal is not a total leech.  They have not received income from me, through taxes, before they illegally enter my home.  As a Christian pastor, certainly I oppose drugs.  I consider alcohol and almost all perscription drugs to be deadly, however; how can I trust a godless secular state to fight a &amp;#39;war on drugs&amp;#39; when these Statists do the things you mention every day?  Jesus come soon!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3958852914338465359'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3958852914338465359'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309483917117#c3958852914338465359' title=''/><author><name>Pastor Riddle</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01946774071713655650</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-116477669"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 30, 2011 at 7:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2603149295411121304</id><published>2011-06-30T14:26:03.040-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-30T14:26:03.040-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Down with the US Government and the War on Drugs!</title><content type='html'>Down with the US Government and the War on Drugs!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/2603149295411121304'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/2603149295411121304'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309465563040#c2603149295411121304' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 30, 2011 at 2:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-196556092408026871</id><published>2011-06-30T05:39:47.938-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-30T05:39:47.938-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Excellent column!  One of the reasons I became dis...</title><content type='html'>Excellent column!  One of the reasons I became disenchanted and left a law enforcment career was because of the heavy focus on victimless crimes and the eagerness for $$$, either through asset forfeiture or federal grants.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve never read you before, but certainly will in the future.  Please check out my blog at www.IfItHitsTheFan.com.  It&amp;#39;s mostly about personal emergency preparedness, but I throw some liberty topics in sometimes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/196556092408026871'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/196556092408026871'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309433987938#c196556092408026871' title=''/><author><name>Donald</name><uri>http://www.IfItHitsTheFan.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-301529617"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 30, 2011 at 5:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6794404971033887877</id><published>2011-06-29T21:58:25.418-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-29T21:58:25.418-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Drug war gravy trainers will keep on feeding. Tric...</title><content type='html'>Drug war gravy trainers will keep on feeding. Tricky Dick had his revenge with the drug war and taking currency off the gold standard. Obammy will massage his inner Nixon and keep the trough nice and well stocked for the gorging maggots. Lefty Mongtards that thought the one was going to legalize are probably having to smoke another one about now.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/6794404971033887877'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/6794404971033887877'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309406305418#c6794404971033887877' title=''/><author><name>Jack Napier</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-432468997"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 29, 2011 at 9:58 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3673288168569526358</id><published>2011-06-29T06:50:04.190-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-29T06:50:04.190-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I once had an employee who habitually whined about...</title><content type='html'>I once had an employee who habitually whined about her out-of-control 5 year old brat. Finally, I had enough. I told her &amp;quot;until you teach him there are immediate and severe consequences to his misbehavior, nothing will change.&amp;quot; Same here.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3673288168569526358'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/3673288168569526358'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309351804190#c3673288168569526358' title=''/><author><name>mark edward marchiafava</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1745362805"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 29, 2011 at 6:50 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5191800861996668789</id><published>2011-06-28T23:43:52.551-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-28T23:43:52.551-06:00</updated><title type='text'>First time I&amp;#39;ve been here but it won&amp;#39;t be ...</title><content type='html'>First time I&amp;#39;ve been here but it won&amp;#39;t be the last! Great work. Keep shining your bright light on these twisted Drug War, Inc. careerists!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/5191800861996668789'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/5191800861996668789'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309326232551#c5191800861996668789' title=''/><author><name>Voletear</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17293632305734211771</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</emai