' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-291146872"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2011 at 7:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2949635699489048227</id><published>2011-06-28T07:00:51.292-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-28T07:00:51.292-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Argggh!  I don&amp;#39;t believe in killing anybody ex...</title><content type='html'>Argggh!  I don&amp;#39;t believe in killing anybody except in immediate defense, but the murdering thugs who took out William Cooper and are divvying up his worldly possessions are strongly tempting me to take up another philosophy.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/2949635699489048227'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/2949635699489048227'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309266051292#c2949635699489048227' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1494771092"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2011 at 7:00 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5409463505025066476</id><published>2011-06-28T00:04:09.181-06:00</published><updated>2011-06-28T00:04:09.181-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I love your clever word choices.  I saw once...</title><content type='html'>Will, I love your clever word choices.  I saw once again the Amerikanischer Einsatzgruppen Panzer from my former home town that was used in that raid upon the Mormon sect in Texas.  That raised my blood pressure I can tell you.  And,yes, the American Soyuz is rife with gun-toting stooges eager to keep the proletariat cowering in a gulag of fear.  Whether it&amp;#39;s shaking down 95 year old grannies or gunning an old man in cold blood what we have are willing accomplices, actors have you, that are more than happy to draw a check, make your life hell, and serve the empire.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/5409463505025066476'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9208529414510079903/comments/default/5409463505025066476'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1309241049181#c5409463505025066476' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/06/drug-wars-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9208529414510079903' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9208529414510079903' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" val